## Google Earth Engine scripts

This folder contains Google Earth Engine (GEE) scripts used to extract environmental predictors linked to annual population-level estimates of extra-pair paternity (EPP).

The scripts use study coordinates, breeding-season timing, and study year information to derive climate variables for each EPP record.

Environmental predictors include:

* ERA5-Land temperature and precipitation summaries,
* daily weather variability metrics,

All extracted variables were exported from Google Earth Engine and merged with the analytical dataset used in the Bayesian phylogenetic models.
